issues.suggestion:
建議在讀取前先檢查 start 是否小於總筆數，或確保 end 不小於 start。例如：
```rust
let count = chain.received_log.count();
if start < count {
    let end = start.saturating_add(CHAIN_INFO_MAX_RECEIVED_LOG_ENTRIES).min(count);
    info.requested_received_log = chain.received_log.read(start..end).await?;
}
```
